el Recordings<\/strong>, illustrent sa capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 cr\u00e9er des ponts entre <strong data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"968\">cultures<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"985\">communaut\u00e9s<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"998\">langues<\/strong> et <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1013\">\u00e9poques<\/strong>, pour une exp\u00e9rience musicale inclusive et vibrante.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1251\">En 2024, Poirier pr\u00e9sente son <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1131\">12e album, \u00ab\u00a0Quiet Revolution\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong>, un opus intime et r\u00e9confortant qui t\u00e9moigne de son \u00e9volution artistique tout en conservant sa chaleur caract\u00e9ristique.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1424\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1297\">Rejoignez-nous le 18 septembre \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al<\/strong> pour une soir\u00e9e inoubliable !<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1463\">\ud83d\udd17 <strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1461\">\u00c9coutez \u00ab\u00a0Quiet Revolution\u00a0\u00bb :<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1599\">\n<li data-section-id=\"12f6hmt\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1530\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/poirier.bandcamp.com\/album\/quietrevolution\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1528\">Bandcamp<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"123n4gx\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1599\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/album\/50ke8NuUI7zhRZA3qP1p1G\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1597\">Spotify<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1848\">Arrivez t\u00f4t, profitez de notre menu et laissez-vous emporter par une <strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1748\">soir\u00e9e musicale \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al<\/strong> unique. Ce <strong data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1788\">party musical \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al<\/stron