r sc\u00e8ne.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1302\">Sous la direction de leur cheffe :<br data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1194\" \/>\u00ab L\u2019art choral\u2026 une passion o\u00f9 chacun, chacune prend conscience de sa voix\u2026 de son corps\u2026 dans l\u2019harmonie. \u00bb<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1307\" \/>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mf8kcp\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1361\">\ud83c\udfa4 Pourquoi assister \u00e0 ce concert \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al ?<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1618\">\n<li data-section-id=\"r7toep\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1408\">D\u00e9couvrir un <strong data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1406\">ch\u0153ur montr\u00e9alais engag\u00e9<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxadke\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1458\">Profiter d\u2019un <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1456\">concert b\u00e9n\u00e9fice accessible<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6zf0hh\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1503\">Encourager la <strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1501\">rel\u00e8ve musicale locale<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16proum\" data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1563\">Vivre une exp\u00e9rience culturelle dans un cadre convivial<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dtkv97\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1618\">Combiner musique et <strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1618\">5 \u00e0 7 gourmand au restaurant<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1623\" \/>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogkbfx\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1656\">\ud83d\udcc5 Informations pratiques<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1802\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1668\">Date :<\/strong> 13 mai<br data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1678\" \/><strong data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1689\">Heure :<\/strong> 19h \u00e0 20h<br data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1702\" \/><strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1712\">Lieu :<\/strong> Robin des Bois, Montr\u00e9al<br data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1740\" \/><str